{"ID":"20240522082301-utqk3vn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082301-utqk3vn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082301-utqk3vn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085502-gesj1z9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085509-v21kfba\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085509-67ovbqh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:29\u0026#125;","title":"頭痛，牙痛，腳痛","type":"doc","updated":"20240522085614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085502-gesj1z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085502-gesj1z9","updated":"20240522085523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"頭痛，牙痛，腳痛(網診)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085502-xa7h3hv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085502-xa7h3hv","updated":"20240522085524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"基本資料"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-1yswe62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-1yswe62","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年齡：56歲  性別：女        體重：68公斤        身高：150cm     體形：很胖"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-njnww4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-njnww4u","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008.07.16    初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-xjbbn9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-xjbbn9s","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-wfd84km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-wfd84km","updated":"20240522085554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近一個月來覺得頭痛，吃中成藥“腦心舒”，症狀有緩解。昨晚睡到十二點多就醒來不能再睡，覺得頭非常痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(晚上十二點是膽經流注時辰)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要痛在兩側太陽穴的位置。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(確認是膽經頭痛)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-iwu3z37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-iwu3z37","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今天一早到鎮衛生院照CT和心電圖。心電圖結果正常，CT結果懷疑有輕度腦梗塞，建議住院。患者不想住院，於是希望試試中藥的效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-uv5k9wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-uv5k9wu","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診項目："}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-zw85985","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-zw85985","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-hw9pxlb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-hw9pxlb","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-83scgp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-83scgp9","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠：近一個月來，每天晚上一般九點左右睡，到淩晨兩、三點左右醒來，之後不能再睡，直到"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-akwq13y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-akwq13y","updated":"20240522085602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天亮，睡中無夢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(長期在肝經流注時辰醒來，表示肝經受損)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-x2ztdta","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-x2ztdta","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-ed74jhu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-ed74jhu","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-4dylfhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-4dylfhj","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口：饑餓感不強，每餐一碗飯，以前是每餐兩碗。口味沒有什麼特別想吃的味道。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-1usk41l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-1usk41l","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-hrd4f3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-hrd4f3a","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：大便一日一行，時間都在差不多天亮的時候。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-4klw5bh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-4klw5bh","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-sn00xz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-sn00xz8","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：小便淡黃色，平均一天約四、五次。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-r0h39a0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-r0h39a0","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-lnuzt2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-lnuzt2j","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：不覺得口渴，但也不會忘記喝水，好像還喝不少水，喝的都是室溫下的涼開水。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-ujwdpa6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-ujwdpa6","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-7ozccxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-7ozccxu","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"寒熱：本人覺得身熱，手腳暖；但其女兒手摸她的手腳，反而覺得比較涼。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-0unebx4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-0unebx4","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-m8fcpga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-m8fcpga","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問汗：容易出汗。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-8vfwkbs","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-8vfwkbs","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-pwstrip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-pwstrip","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力,精神：自己本人覺得體力精神還不錯，不覺得疲憊。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-68omdlm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-68omdlm","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085509-ddp8x39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-ddp8x39","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經 : 今年五十六歲，已經絕經三、四年。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-wcft8u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-wcft8u9","updated":"20240522085530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加味溫膽湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-9hygij4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-9hygij4","updated":"20240522085532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏9  柴胡12  竹茹9  玉竹9  黃芩9  白芍9  勾藤9  甘草3  生薑3片  大棗4枚（擘開） 川芎9  茯苓9  白朮9"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-j3xv3t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-j3xv3t6","updated":"20240522085533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"7碗水（1400ml)煮成3碗水(600ml),早中晚飯後各溫服一碗，3付。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-ckhez9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-ckhez9h","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008.07.18  二診"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-iiby3dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-iiby3dw","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、原先的頭痛症狀消失，睡眠改善，能從晚上九點睡到第二天早上四點，期間要起來小便一次，可以很快重新入睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-dchv25o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-dchv25o","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、補充：原有右膝關節內側疼痛，今天早上發現右膝關節後膀胱經位置有痛感。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-iqaqddq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-iqaqddq","updated":"20240522085610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、補充：原先有下牙痛，白天不怎麼痛，晚上睡醒時比較痛。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（有時只有當患者接受中藥效果時，才會將其他不適症狀一併說出。）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-wq0wxrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-wq0wxrk","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、右側耳後膽經位置於昨天午後出現陣發性疼痛，到晚上至今沒再痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-ea7mpxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-ea7mpxy","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、胃口增加，可以吃一碗半飯。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-mf7shok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-mf7shok","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、喝水沒有原先的多。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-xxqle9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-xxqle9r","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、精神比服藥前好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-5yzx31i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-5yzx31i","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-14nwk3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-14nwk3h","updated":"20240522085536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏9  柴胡12  竹茹9  玉竹9  黃芩9  白芍9  勾藤9  甘草3  生薑3片  大棗4枚（擘開） 川芎9  茯苓9  白朮9  牛膝9  桂枝9"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-4eh2v7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-4eh2v7x","updated":"20240522085537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"7碗水（1400ml)煮成3碗水(600ml),早中晚飯後各溫服一碗，5付。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-38j17tp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-38j17tp","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2008.07.24  三診"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-jexj2e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-jexj2e4","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、右膝關節後膀胱經位置稍比之前更痛。（與之前相比疼痛稍甚）"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-xzxm9wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-xzxm9wq","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、右側下牙痛仍舊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-wz5pt62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-wz5pt62","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、胃口開，一餐可吃兩碗飯。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-1nhh3h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-1nhh3h5","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可否描述一下膝蓋後面如何痛？是皮膚痛/肌肉痛/骨頭痛/筋痛？"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-h3yeads","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-h3yeads","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"答:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是筋痛，在膀胱經的位置，具體位置是上自委中穴所在的橫紋始，至下移約三寸之間。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-67ovbqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-67ovbqh","updated":"20240522085614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膀胱經痛，加葛根湯；肝主筋，加延胡索舒筋止痛，女貞子潤肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-jkp04us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-jkp04us","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-sphce1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-sphce1c","updated":"20240522085540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡12  黃芩9   竹茹9  勾藤9  炙甘草9  桂枝9   白芍30 生薑3片 大棗4枚（擘開）  葛根20  延胡索9  女貞子9"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-ud9r1yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-ud9r1yn","updated":"20240522085540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"7碗水（1400ml)煮成3碗水(600ml),早中晚飯後各溫服一碗，5付。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-j3ldmun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-j3ldmun","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"頭痛及牙痛均沒有了，腳痛好了8成。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-rfshggr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-rfshggr","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再服2付痊癒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-gdb7b8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-gdb7b8m","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"弟子 黑天使 敬書"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-3ho0xub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-3ho0xub","updated":"20240522085545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這位同學光是讀過人紀DVD就有如此功力，不但辨症精準，下處方也是藥藥到位，彈無虛發，雖然現在他仍然就讀於某中醫學院中，尚未畢業，但是我可以預見他將來必然會是一位經方大醫，我非常開心有這種傑出弟子加入經方家的行列，其未來的成就必然是無可限量。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085509-v21kfba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085509-v21kfba","updated":"20240522085509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫 倪海厦謹記於08/11/2008"}]}]}